  unitName: Bahamut
  unitId: 50103
  unitNumber: 148
  description: Among the many dragons, there are giant, extremely powerful dragons
    that go by the name Bahamut. They swoop down and suppress conflicts and disputes
    between other dragons. Their judgement is always fair, and no one ever objects.
    When someone has been judged to have harmed nature, Bahamut passes divine punishment
    as a representative of all dragons.
  summonDesc: The gods have alread decided.<br>I am the will of this world.<br>Can
    you bear the earth's will?
  fusionDesc: If you hold justice within you,<br>you can use my strength as you will.
  evoDesc: I will be the signpost<br>that lights your path.
